{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1458,
  "batch_count": 1689,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "4c77e29d79c031b121c5d2d0a53ce8b0070eb9a1",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44c6467063b66b55ca5ae283",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "気分いいから、\r\nカメラ目線で走っちゃおっかな～？\r\n新感覚楽しめそうじゃんね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f50c75c407aae113a8d1efb117ae6609b0d9ab0923749b1325ba71605b65f745",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03bd9f4a629355c678e0fc60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "バチバチの競り合いとか\r\n激やば展開起きないかな？\r\nあはっ、高まるね～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "051532c3c8d3b26acaa7581e65cb5f60b01b8d5316ca7c5abeeaf482a36947b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e18d8c09e6b6d8a2f6218acf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いい仕上がりになったよん。\r\nウチの情報、使いこなせてるね～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1591cf12f97cfde6d75532d2be8b021dd2dcb405eea43e01242fcac8d7b2c4ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72b75b675b70028172a434ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情報通り、み～んな仕上げて\r\nきてるねぇ。…んでまあ、ウチらは\r\nその上をいっちゃいましょーってね",
      "source_fingerprint": "eca777a4e57c26e65b4aeee8184b00878b55afa27ec601df5cdd70e029d18d71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5035e898249169283406804d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うし、必要な情報はまとまったかな\r\nあとは本番で、どう使うか――",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b93143d93d0b254ab1fdccb2882568c080963ae2b4ddd33b443a5772c0eca60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a60bb64bb1fe0e2fc9331e9f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ウチならいつも通りだけど…お、\r\nあっちの子、前と雰囲気違うね。\r\nチェックチェック～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2acd689ae423684738c883be813868ff019f22e6293697b12741910f39a0f723",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c365bce2dedc540b5ca2627b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "めいっぱい楽しんでくるよん。\r\nそれが1番大事じゃん？",
      "source_fingerprint": "434b19721756f8e885d96fa68383ecc1184a206a087ba02924e4a3178984fee4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f9e5dfde74374f8a598b7f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "んー…走り出したら\r\n気分も変わんのかな～。\r\nま、期待しすぎないでおこ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39f058060e6b5553201fd79385d7eea131c8089737953895e66722a0dd6bc300",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:157c10e469f439bacdb30523",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "んー、イマイチしまらないな～。\r\n調子の悪さは、\r\n情報で補うしかないかも…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfe3abf2e7314bc7283b758a37b9839d7effc8bfd56e93c777a112309332f8c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1afb07b200712ec2b9443917",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やっぱ調子上がんないな…。\r\nばっちり糖分補給したのに～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9be5d977476f850342794c726a238854b660f8153563d6e0e36e039d29f2def7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db3eceb00905657ca0eaa415",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "こんな状態で走るって、\r\nある意味未知のレースか～。\r\nそれを楽しめるといいけど…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fe55494e0ad1c28049aecf0eb1874310b260dcccd6d94f04b6ec50b9364ba71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e286d14ece2814842d9f83f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "他所のいい情報が耳に痛いや…。\r\nはぁ…今は何も聞かずに集中～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5eff0d8d24c32336fa784d04c6e11ecfe65a8d812f8e075dfeaf875748e8a0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac69c897c7a51e460e9d561e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "タブレットのカタログ読んでも\r\nテンション上がんない～。\r\nガチ重症だなこりゃ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ad538ad1f283ea614be5044148fbb46b428406bf04bdad755bac7f0090e11d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:578d4df7cb01cd474c40258f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さて。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ccc0a4c1d8553a1216b70a22cc2817117c30e5db50980ed67df860ae5ad58f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84d89e4ea37b53bdd0b560e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いくよん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7bd14fb134e57c1662a098cf82370338a9d93079ae0206650ff710129fc96a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bf7f3d8030084242b08195f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おしゃ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5b4f5514b136caea27bb7aa7677c9b37cf1171beb9523a89b7073c8ccf8a53d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b36a8731325731d8d9e35d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふむり。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16fd775ca430e8a9a662f104f0e790815b8c5e82649332e39903b252982307d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecb0141369cd2ce0c688d337",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あちゃー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08a01c3e877ffd3baf722dd5c85c1114c2112be9b4e9decb1ef6534b2952beda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb5e75f3207de8851b4dd272",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ぐはぁ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f58530f26d9002a0d2778033150e33b21d92928658dc1dcc67330e2b2c19cc8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ac4845c0721fe8df1569738",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いこっか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f60e3b1eac4b2d1208500ca87f1a880f17126f4dc628d1fbb6c257c4aa76368c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dde1d3d2a1ad3a7764d165d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いえ～い。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b162228f78da0bfd17588980fe82fce92bdcd87c5b65acd3e196eeba7a11264b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d57a1d7f55e72a58310314d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やっぱ相性いいよね、ウチら。",
      "source_fingerprint": "132fc76bae7a007f08d3e3c60be5d8add3bfaf34f810e0668b9131f149592e77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78efb89066088db5706b894b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おつおつ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8212a038c58c35c07d6bfc7ae2ecb121fd6ce9381618202f298765572fcd5de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06286f94b10f19d5c22feda7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やりますか～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ddfa6a8b8fa76ef639759cc8d4d7fa4805ca79e3d1ad63f5f68d765d9d98467",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e717951a6ce0246c257ed4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "じゃ、いこっか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "990c07543865fa096e579149ca14ccdadfec78abc7ceb8927e290a992d06a489",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:954f884337572b81a7c633d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おつおつ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8212a038c58c35c07d6bfc7ae2ecb121fd6ce9381618202f298765572fcd5de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd7db44d22c7bc6a9cec3832",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情報通り、み～んな仕上げて\r\nきてるねぇ。…んでまあ、ウチらは\r\nその上をいっちゃいましょーってね",
      "source_fingerprint": "eca777a4e57c26e65b4aeee8184b00878b55afa27ec601df5cdd70e029d18d71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f25bda4245c43ed31c82cf3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "気分いいから、\r\nカメラ目線で走っちゃおっかな～？\r\n新感覚楽しめそうじゃんね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f50c75c407aae113a8d1efb117ae6609b0d9ab0923749b1325ba71605b65f745",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:150631b1ef63dea2412420eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おつおつ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8212a038c58c35c07d6bfc7ae2ecb121fd6ce9381618202f298765572fcd5de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cba3b59674c0a9f55be9053d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さて。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ccc0a4c1d8553a1216b70a22cc2817117c30e5db50980ed67df860ae5ad58f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48db657a33d9bf3726e263f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "収穫はあったよん。次こそ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa743534787fd8d6a0630aee73a8384b6738bcae07716f1efdc6ae40f20d744e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f50dd8aa21534cfb8a29da3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "まだまだこっからっしょ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b344e777f7805e25999ddb1aa807a73d32cad947e4233a97b63a69bc965f44d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef5b5cc56836579451c66fb8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情報、アプデしないと…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15d5384ca3e823ca37108641670eaf390a0a79080c04ad51b3490c6c054827c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16a9e203e07b57a41e9987d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "もっとワクワクしたいのに～…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd60060d028ed3f6214a96922310f5118c8f201baf0471b4951ed583584b3772",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d8e4734240ff2d3531e1f5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "う～～ん…！\r\nゾクゾクしたぁ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a701ad87d0f233c2feccf3083d12504cadeddfb292c710e34e411c7202eaa31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2dd5c85c431f59b493990f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大勝利～。\r\nこれ、特ダネっしょ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7e94d40e4880a0169b6f5809a13e0ddbb036fc282d452462338357513c4a518",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b52926722abf0d6fc3f279e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行きますか～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b184c7bb1eeb3775f27f6ca44b5d4aa66ff598852775379db99aa5fbee99af1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2fdc982d07a232d955a1bdc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ほい、いただき～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1c818b251d83c349eea8adff87a3be707a805348dbeb04d4fea62d89b9e204e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5df97ba36a5dc263f9804c88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "知りたい…もっと知りたい。\r\n激やば情報、未知の世界…！\r\nあはっ、最高～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d70ab2d650c04a902a8f8d58b1d2d0398d47597168c4b2c5fb376862c194e353",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b76476514699f971f6c2afda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ねね、まだ～？\r\n先飛び出しちゃうぞ～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f96d42f8d631a4606d3b8623fe385ee5b684a641a060bb99fd222055326f1267",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbb9ea9c9cc9003e3aaa52e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "息苦しいくらいの熱気！\r\n～～っ、ゾクゾクしちゃうね～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80d29ea61f20a66aa63c36e14dbd4f15d2f79883f19187bfd427a26eb2961933",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a26ba164642546c7df3b30d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレちゃん、次はなに試す？",
      "source_fingerprint": "01016fd962cbb2f49c5aec344f303302c8b408387c18a2d11602f242cafc23d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63f3923371066995ce050f8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ウチらのつき合いも\r\n長くなったよね～。\r\nおかげさまで、まー楽しいよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91d27ba5c6bbe941b7c417d9e373ec9db0b27c0ba58385bcdb9588346098b903",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:811aecf75a325f553fe526c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学園生って信用あるじゃん？\r\n制服だと聞き込みが楽でよき～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91cbc872576575c4fad373def3cbb73603b889857b3e1998e5b68a84a53138d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd699742016af6fa32f138bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "かわいいっしょ～？\r\n正直に言いなって～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f2048104b0264acae550becc3e3f0e580b7ebbeb0f2bd16c18c6cf3dcb55f0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:322793156dc7676e9cf0558b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やっぱベルトは巻いてなんぼ。\r\nもっと足してもいいかも～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62b2f663d5b3af73fbea9c18b61e70d4ae5514080290f9c6be7607ee54ee5651",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b37e1a5580967f7182bc0939",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "フィット感がたまらんねー。\r\n素材に秘密アリと見た。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3155eb349e7ed7b8b63d7b7f586d20912710878e0dab6711241fbe70db017e51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
