      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfb2a926cbeaf3e7afb949ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どこに電子メモしまおっかな～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a36110d415c4652fa0621308fe8325fe21878f63fad28f964aecaf211787d6e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bb15f6c435e76d25bf75625",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お疲れさーん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9103f54580f8fbd821d2d77e512ed81649ede914f5c0728a5b1a88a572b9742e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ec02ea772a44e4b7a0d512d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふあぁ～…。\r\n深夜の通販番組ってさー、\r\nたまーにツボついてくるよね～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9543412997d42fe96f181fa3743e20e80cf23e649d1e48c8802b3dae170a2466",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34f7565576f128cf6b512187",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今朝のニュース見た～？\r\nまだならトピックス送るよん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ce59021366519444395fea17b64b0fc791be199dad3582c76ff6b1b153c6963",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:455a6b384998930c988906e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さて、お昼に仕入れた\r\n情報を精査しますか～。\r\n鮮度が命、ってね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cff99c192fd817880d563572827027dbdd98ce4c3fc2433b437dc045e406e361",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fb8a34db7e89aef8fc38e4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よーよー、トレちゃんよー。お昼は\r\nウチの見っけた隠れ家パン屋さんで\r\nど？ウケるメニューが多くてさぁ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "827d5cab446dda44a4e970b48ac58e3602ea711fa2e08ba2ea85b28e6445f620",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4d834f0a5807490fd12be24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『深夜の校舎裏にUFO発見！』\r\n…行きたい。けど門限が――\r\nトレちゃん、なんとかならない？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5229c63365b0f5e78037ca1085b87b86473e35c3dfa2ad73bc73d06cdad3da7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:383ab07f7c2f893c1f0f9d8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今からだと、朝までコースか…。\r\nねーねー、動画編集のアシ、\r\nはちみーLでどう？",
      "source_fingerprint": "962beebfb82fb6044711e98280e07d1625a8241a65164be71f511fcbd5c84e46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3921b95e96640710a3c0268",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お花見のマル秘スポット？\r\n知ってる知ってる。\r\nんじゃー代金は桜餅でよろ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93d428ba49ac166163c0bd9059798912eee1477ef06895c95294fae77a509a67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c46bb464601292b0498bd53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏と言えば怪談！\r\nヒエッヒエになれるネタ、\r\nた～くさん仕入れてあるよん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1131f5c30bf06460f61927b5604940c7d25b56658b95079e0e1eafa10c1ad5e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4a6e6e5b0ab67f0bdfd3198",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "紅葉撮り行かな～い？\r\nトイカメラでどっちがエモく\r\nできるか、勝負しよ～ぜい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef30438cfd1c13f276a9a1e10244745f425862ed8c7eef1c135b4f6a7dd5ebe6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72ca0f2b0ce3bde6e474b951",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "う～～、さぶっ！\r\nゾクゾクは求めてるけど、\r\nこういうんじゃないんだよね～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85ee5266553c30a3ee86a844d1744d357a8c36eed5ff1580db8b6a4344d7ab30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cebcce74c44d5145ba4d52a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヘイヘイ、バレンタイ～ン♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "38b9de32e8e847af3aa3b85f95f9bd1e6342e6b6008d522ff78dc186cc79374e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5944804d49e6c06ccdb8602",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "フリオ、地元の話してると\r\nすんごいかわいい顔すんの。\r\nあの笑顔、ずるいよね～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff08cdda5b26b32b49b6f8bd1d4b53cfd8c42eb359c05cdf0396985071371af5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7463ea35858d5b3efd84ccec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "わ、フォロワー爆増してる。\r\n…コラボ効果、エグいな～。\r\nさっすがカレン。カリスマだわぁ",
      "source_fingerprint": "d01b1e319806bc37779dcf305314aa82ca7affcef3d4fd546627add01466dc32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:caf2f920db26e25daf77c96c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "エスポんにあ～んしても、\r\n絶対拒否られんだよね。\r\n次は不意打ち試そ～っと。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f8e27983099a69cd5bf214ba8a0e428120b09116fa03a0dabe5ec0cacaa9763",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b56ed0d5af3c9c41cabe7f1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふっふっふ。最強の静電気防止\r\nインナーをゲットしたよん。\r\nどっからでもかかってこ～い…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dceae8200d26add7d66196a7e4e8a38e380d1fa131d5dbc41821683e35b118a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5c2cb8ec8b69294a25cf6dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "とーさんたちの撮影現場って、\r\nガチだからゾクっとすんだよね。\r\nそりゃいい画を撮るわけだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "78073eac895b14d071a63635c51ea32267ff2a031c17ebacdb71d4c7af0ebaaa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96ea9b418970dbdd9685d6d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ダンスのコツ聞かれてさ、情報\r\n渡すつもりが踊ってみせるハメに…\r\nごっつかわいい系の振り、疲れた～",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b837fa74f863de6dee1ccdfb956e8fc7a0dfebbcf4832db59b24ff4913da9f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce135290bb00bbf708693866",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ね、この衣装さー、\r\n冷却ファン内蔵させない？\r\nライブ中もきっと涼しいよ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcb10499339a247d1db44f3dc2346703cd4ca67e0e7e2c34e5128de499e28b46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8413fd67be981387182f61d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "攻め攻めでいいっしょ？\r\nレースもガンガン行こう、\r\nって気になれるんだよね～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cecac6c334b9b7e481c85caa510a9bfed8997d727cb8bf0498c210db9e6ea2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e36f4b00b8fc7fd61efae8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "このポーチは亜空間に繋がってて、\r\n情報屋アイテムが飛び出すのさ。\r\n…あはっ、信じた？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfbba41ddd023a26803df44450beac798583bf4284f4672a31c956e1bd2acd26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91008"
      ]
    }
  ]
